--- !u!114 &2107000022
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2107000020}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7feeaa53da5f4777803a6b8b1afb2c0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScamReady.Tutorial.TutorialFlow
  controller: {fileID: 2068168510}
  overlay: {fileID: 2107000019}
  evidenceContainer: {fileID: 2107000008}
  steps:
  - title: Your student desktop
    body: 'Read the background on the desktop. You are expecting a textbook delivery.
      A new email has arrived.


      This tutorial shows you how to read a contact,
      check its claims through trusted sources, save evidence and choose a response.'
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000015}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 0
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 0
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
  - title: Open your email
    body: Click Email to read the new message. The notification at the bottom is
      another way to open it.
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000001}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 1
    eventType: 1
    targetId: TUT_EMAIL_REDELIVERY_REQUEST
  - title: Read before you respond
    body: 'Check the sender, From and Reply-To addresses, and what the message asks
      you to do. Scroll to read the full email.


      Proceed opens the requested
      page. Process on that page submits the requested information.

      Stop Contact
      returns to the desktop so you can check.

      Ignore leaves the message unanswered.

      Reject
      / Report rejects the contact.


      A familiar name or an official-looking
      link does not prove a message is genuine.'
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000003}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 2107000004}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 0
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 0
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
  - title: Pause and check
    body: Click Stop Contact to return to the desktop. This pauses the contact so
      you can verify its claims; it does not end the scenario.
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000005}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 1
    eventType: 3
    targetId: TUT_EMAIL_REDELIVERY_REQUEST
  - title: Use an independent source
    body: Open Browser. Its homepage provides trusted sources you can visit independently
      of the email link.
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000002}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 1
    eventType: 5
    targetId: 
  - title: Check your real order
    body: Open Harbour Parcel Tracking. The saved order uses the tracking number
      from your original order confirmation.
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000006}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 1
    eventType: 7
    targetId: TUT_PAGE_PACKAGE_TRACKING
  - title: Compare the information
    body: 'Read the official tracking information and compare it with the email.
      Does this order show a failed delivery or a payment request?


      Scroll
      if needed. Next, you will save the relevant information as evidence.'
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000007}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 2107000007}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 0
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 0
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
  - title: Save useful evidence
    body: "Click the highlighted evidence card to save the order status. This record
      helps you check the email\u2019s claim that delivery has already failed.\n\nSaved
      evidence appears in Notes. You can scroll this area if needed."
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 0}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 2107000007}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 1
    completion: 1
    eventType: 8
    targetId: TUT_E01_PARCEL_STATUS
  - title: Notice the pressure
    body: 'The sender is pushing you to act before a deadline. Urgency is a reason
      to pause and check, not proof that the request is genuine.


      Close this
      reminder with X and continue checking.'
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000009}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 2107000010}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 2
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
  - title: Open your notes
    body: Click Notes to review the evidence you saved. The number shows how many
      pieces of evidence you have collected.
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000011}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 1
    eventType: 9
    targetId: 
  - title: Review your evidence
    body: "Notes keeps the source and a short summary of each saved fact. Use these
      facts to compare the contact\u2019s claims with independently checked information.\n\nOne
      useful fact may not answer every question. You can collect more evidence from
      another source."
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000012}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 2107000013}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 0
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 0
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
  - title: Return to checking
    body: Close Notes with X. Your evidence stays saved while you continue investigating.
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 2107000014}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 1
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 3
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
  - title: 'Return to Browser homepage '
    body: Click here to back to homepage.
    nextLabel: Next
    focusTarget: {fileID: 423523114}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 0
    allowTargetClick: 1
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 0
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
  - title: Try the rest yourself
    body: 'You can now use all controls freely.


      In Browser, use All sources
      to find the delivery safety policy. You may save another piece of evidence.


      Close
      Browser to return to the desktop, reopen Email and decide how to respond. Your
      final choice is yours; the result will explain it.'
    nextLabel: Got it
    focusTarget: {fileID: 0}
    interactionTarget: {fileID: 0}
    scrollArea: {fileID: 0}
    blockInput: 0
    allowTargetClick: 0
    focusEvidence: 0
    completion: 0
    eventType: 0
    targetId: 
